| Male, No. (%)                   | 52(53.06%)      | 51(49.04%)       | 0.619 a   |
| Age, mean (SD)                  | 23.16(9.34)     | 23.14(5.64)      | 0.987 b   |
| Educational level, mean (SD), y | 11.95(3.04)     | 15.21(3.17)      | < 0.001 b |
| Y-BOCS, mean (SD)               | 21.73(6.91)     | -                | -         |
